37019>>>>>    Procedure SetActionButtons
37022>>>>>        tWebNavigateData NavigateData
37022>>>>>        tWebNavigateData NavigateData
37022>>>>>        Boolean bHasRecord
37022>>>>>        Handle hoDD
37022>>>>>
37022>>>>>        Get Server to hoDD
37023>>>>>        Get GetNavigateData to NavigateData
37024>>>>>        Get HasRecord of hoDD to bHasRecord
37025>>>>>
37025>>>>>        // let's hide all buttons and then Show the ones we want
37025>>>>>        WebSet pbRender of oEditBtn to False
37026>>>>>        WebSet pbRender of oSaveBtn to False
37027>>>>>        WebSet pbRender of oCancelChangesBtn to False
37028>>>>>        WebSet pbRender of oDeleteBtn to False
37029>>>>>
37029>>>>>        If (NavigateData.bReadOnly) Begin
37031>>>>>            WebSet pbRender of oEditBtn to True
37032>>>>>        End
37032>>>>>>
37032>>>>>        Else Begin
37033>>>>>            WebSet pbRender of oSaveBtn to True
37034>>>>>            WebSet pbRender of oCancelChangesBtn to True
37035>>>>>            WebSet pbRender of oDeleteBtn to bHasRecord
37036>>>>>        End
37036>>>>>>
37036>>>>>    End_Procedure
